"``uv_process_options_t.stdio`` is an array of ``uv_stdio_container_t``, "
"which is:"
msgstr "实际的程序 ``proc-streams`` 运行的就是上述代码，不过它只共享 ``stderr``。子进程的文件描述符通过 ``stdio`` 字段设置，该字段位于 ``uv_process_options_t`` 中。首先把 ``stdio_count`` 字段设置为要设置的文件描述符的数目。``uv_process_options_t.stdio`` 是一个 ``uv_stdio_container_t`` 数组，其结构如下："

#: ../../src/guide/processes.rst:201
msgid ""
"where flags can have several values. Use ``UV_IGNORE`` if it isn't going "
"to be used. If the first three ``stdio`` fields are marked as "
"``UV_IGNORE`` they'll redirect to ``/dev/null``."
msgstr "其中 flags 可以取多个值。如果不会用到它，就使用 ``UV_IGNORE``。如果前三个 ``stdio`` 字段被标记为 ``UV_IGNORE``，它们将被重定向到 ``/dev/null``。"

#: ../../src/guide/processes.rst:205
msgid ""
"Since we want to pass on an existing descriptor, we'll use "
"``UV_INHERIT_FD``. Then we set the ``fd`` to ``stderr``."
msgstr "由于我们想传递一个已有的描述符，因此使用 ``UV_INHERIT_FD``。然后将 ``fd`` 设置为 ``stderr``。"

#: ../../src/guide/processes.rst:208
msgid "proc-streams/main.c"
msgstr "proc-streams/main.c"

#: ../../src/guide/processes.rst:215
msgid ""
"If you run ``proc-stream`` you'll see that only the line \"This is "
"stderr\" will be displayed. Try marking ``stdout`` as being inherited and"
" see the output."
msgstr "如果运行 ``proc-stream``，你将看到只显示 \"This is stderr\" 这一行。试着把 ``stdout`` 标记为继承，然后查看输出。"

#: ../../src/guide/processes.rst:218
msgid ""
"It is dead simple to apply this redirection to streams.  By setting "
"``flags`` to ``UV_INHERIT_STREAM`` and setting ``data.stream`` to the "
"stream in the parent process, the child process can treat that stream as "
"standard I/O. This can be used to implement something like CGI_."
msgstr "把这种重定向应用到流上非常简单。将 ``flags`` 设置为 ``UV_INHERIT_STREAM``，并把 ``data.stream`` 设置为父进程中的流，子进程就可以把这个流当作标准 I/O。这可以用来实现类似 CGI_ 的功能。"

#: ../../src/guide/processes.rst:225
msgid "A sample CGI script/executable is:"
msgstr "一个 CGI 脚本/可执行文件的示例如下："

#: ../../src/guide/processes.rst:227
msgid "cgi/tick.c"
msgstr "cgi/tick.c"

#: ../../src/guide/processes.rst:231
msgid ""
"The CGI server combines the concepts from this chapter and "
":doc:`networking` so that every client is sent ten ticks after which that"
" connection is closed."
msgstr "CGI 服务器结合了本章和 :doc:`networking` 中的概念，它会向每个客户端发送十个 tick，然后关闭该连接。"

#: ../../src/guide/processes.rst:234 ../../src/guide/processes.rst:244
msgid "cgi/main.c"
msgstr "cgi/main.c"

#: ../../src/guide/processes.rst:241
msgid ""
"Here we simply accept the TCP connection and pass on the socket "
"(*stream*) to ``invoke_cgi_script``."
msgstr "这里我们只是接受 TCP 连接，并把套接字（*流*）传递给 ``invoke_cgi_script``。"

#: ../../src/guide/processes.rst:251
msgid ""
"The ``stdout`` of the CGI script is set to the socket so that whatever "
"our tick script prints, gets sent to the client. By using processes, we "
"can offload the read/write buffering to the operating system, so in terms"
" of convenience this is great. Just be warned that creating processes is "
"a costly task."
msgstr "CGI 脚本的 ``stdout`` 被设置为此套接字，因此我们的 tick 脚本打印的任何内容都会被发送给客户端。通过使用进程，我们可以把读写缓冲的工作交给操作系统，就便利性而言这非常好。只是要注意，创建进程是一项开销很大的任务。"

#: ../../src/guide/processes.rst:259
msgid "Parent-child IPC"
msgstr "父子进程 IPC"

#: ../../src/guide/processes.rst:261
msgid ""
"A parent and child can have one or two way communication over a pipe "
"created by settings ``uv_stdio_container_t.flags`` to a bit-wise "
"combination of ``UV_CREATE_PIPE`` and ``UV_READABLE_PIPE`` or "
"``UV_WRITABLE_PIPE``. The read/write flag is from the perspective of the "
"child process.  In this case, the ``uv_stream_t* stream`` field must be "
"set to point to an initialized, unopened ``uv_pipe_t`` instance."
msgstr "父进程和子进程可以通过管道进行单向或双向通信，方法是创建管道时把 ``uv_stdio_container_t.flags`` 设置为 ``UV_CREATE_PIPE`` 与 ``UV_READABLE_PIPE`` 或 ``UV_WRITABLE_PIPE`` 的按位组合。读/写标志是从子进程的视角来看的。在这种情况下，``uv_stream_t* stream`` 字段必须设置为指向一个已初始化但尚未打开的 ``uv_pipe_t`` 实例。"

#: ../../src/guide/processes.rst:269
msgid "New stdio Pipes"
msgstr "新的 stdio 管道"

#: ../../src/guide/processes.rst:271
msgid ""
"The ``uv_pipe_t`` structure represents more than just `pipe(7)`_ (or "
"``|``), but supports any streaming file-like objects. On Windows, the "
"only object of that description is the `Named Pipe`_.  On Unix, this "
"could be any of `Unix Domain Socket`_, or derived from `mkfifo(1)`_, or "
"it could actually be a `pipe(7)`_.  When ``uv_spawn`` initializes a "
"``uv_pipe_t`` due to the `UV_CREATE_PIPE` flag, it opts for creating a "
"`socketpair(2)`_."
msgstr "``uv_pipe_t`` 结构体所代表的不只是 `pipe(7)`_ （或 ``|``），它还支持任何类文件的流对象。在 Windows 上，符合这一描述的对象只有 `Named Pipe`_。在 Unix 上，它可以是 `Unix Domain Socket`_，也可以派生自 `mkfifo(1)`_，或者它实际上就是一个 `pipe(7)`_。当 ``uv_spawn`` 因 `UV_CREATE_PIPE` 标志而初始化 ``uv_pipe_t`` 时，它会选择创建一个 `socketpair(2)`_。"

#: ../../src/guide/processes.rst:278
msgid ""
"This is intended for the purpose of allowing multiple libuv processes to "
"communicate with IPC. This is discussed below."
msgstr "这样做的目的是让多个 libuv 进程能够通过 IPC 进行通信。下文会讨论这一点。"

#: ../../src/guide/processes.rst:289
msgid "Arbitrary process IPC"
msgstr "任意进程间的 IPC"

#: ../../src/guide/processes.rst:291
msgid ""
"Since domain sockets [#]_ can have a well known name and a location in "
"the file-system they can be used for IPC between unrelated processes. The"
" D-BUS_ system used by open source desktop environments uses domain "
"sockets for event notification. Various applications can then react when "
"a contact comes online or new hardware is detected. The MySQL server also"
" runs a domain socket on which clients can interact with it."
msgstr "由于域套接字 [#]_ 可以拥有一个广为人知的名字以及文件系统中的位置，它们可以用于不相关进程之间的 IPC。开源桌面环境所使用的 D-BUS_ 系统就利用域套接字进行事件通知。这样一来，当联系人上线或检测到新硬件时，各种应用程序都可以做出反应。MySQL 服务器同样运行着一个域套接字，客户端可以通过它与服务器交互。"

#: ../../src/guide/processes.rst:300
msgid ""
"When using domain sockets, a client-server pattern is usually followed "
"with the creator/owner of the socket acting as the server. After the "
"initial setup, messaging is no different from TCP, so we'll re-use the "
"echo server example."
msgstr "使用域套接字时，通常遵循客户端-服务器模式，由套接字的创建者/所有者充当服务器。完成初始设置之后，消息传递与 TCP 并无不同，因此我们将复用回显服务器的示例。"

#: ../../src/guide/processes.rst:304
msgid "pipe-echo-server/main.c"
msgstr "pipe-echo-server/main.c"

#: ../../src/guide/processes.rst:311
msgid ""
"We name the socket ``echo.sock`` which means it will be created in the "
"local directory. This socket now behaves no different from TCP sockets as"
" far as the stream API is concerned. You can test this server using "
"`socat`_::"
msgstr "我们把这个套接字命名为 ``echo.sock``，这意味着它将被创建在本地目录中。就流 API 而言，这个套接字现在的行为与 TCP 套接字并无区别。你可以使用 `socat`_ 来测试这个服务器::"

#: ../../src/guide/processes.rst:317
msgid "A client which wants to connect to a domain socket will use::"
msgstr "想要连接到域套接字的客户端将使用::"

#: ../../src/guide/processes.rst:321
msgid ""
"where ``name`` will be ``echo.sock`` or similar. On Unix systems, "
"``name`` must point to a valid file (e.g. ``/tmp/echo.sock``). On "
"Windows, ``name`` follows a ``\\\\?\\pipe\\echo.sock`` format."
msgstr "其中 ``name`` 将是 ``echo.sock`` 或类似的值。在 Unix 系统上，``name`` 必须指向一个有效文件（例如 ``/tmp/echo.sock``）。在 Windows 上，``name`` 采用 ``\\\\?\\pipe\\echo.sock`` 这样的格式。"

#: ../../src/guide/processes.rst:328
msgid "Sending file descriptors over pipes"
msgstr "通过管道发送文件描述符"

#: ../../src/guide/processes.rst:330
msgid ""
"The cool thing about domain sockets is that file descriptors can be "
"exchanged between processes by sending them over a domain socket. This "
"allows processes to hand off their I/O to other processes. Applications "
"include load-balancing servers, worker processes and other ways to make "
"optimum use of CPU. libuv only supports sending **TCP sockets or other "
"pipes** over pipes for now."
msgstr "域套接字的妙处在于，可以通过域套接字在进程之间交换文件描述符。这使得进程可以把 I/O 移交给其他进程。应用场景包括负载均衡服务器、工作进程以及其他充分利用 CPU 的方式。目前 libuv 只支持通过管道发送 **TCP 套接字或其他管道**。"

#: ../../src/guide/processes.rst:336
msgid ""
"To demonstrate, we will look at an echo server implementation that hands "
"off clients to worker processes in a round-robin fashion. This program is"
" a bit involved, and while only snippets are included in the book, it is "
"recommended to read the full code to really understand it."
msgstr "为了演示，我们来看一个回显服务器的实现，它以轮转的方式把客户端移交给各个工作进程。这个程序有点复杂，虽然书中只包含了一些代码片段，但建议阅读完整的代码来真正理解它。"

#: ../../src/guide/processes.rst:341
msgid ""
"The worker process is quite simple, since the file-descriptor is handed "
"over to it by the master."
msgstr "工作进程本身相当简单，因为文件描述符是由主进程移交给它的。"

#: ../../src/guide/processes.rst:344 ../../src/guide/processes.rst:358
msgid "multi-echo-server/worker.c"
msgstr "multi-echo-server/worker.c"

#: ../../src/guide/processes.rst:351
msgid ""
"``queue`` is the pipe connected to the master process on the other end, "
"along which new file descriptors get sent. It is important to set the "
"``ipc`` argument of ``uv_pipe_init`` to 1 to indicate this pipe will be "
"used for inter-process communication! Since the master will write the "
"file handle to the standard input of the worker, we connect the pipe to "
"``stdin`` using ``uv_pipe_open``."
msgstr "``queue`` 是另一端连接到主进程的管道，新的文件描述符经由这条管道发送。重要的是把 ``ipc`` 参数设置为 1，该参数属于 ``uv_pipe_init``，以此表明这条管道将用于进程间通信！由于主进程会把文件句柄写入工作进程的标准输入，我们把管道连接到 ``stdin``，使用 ``uv_pipe_open``。"

#: ../../src/guide/processes.rst:365
msgid ""
"First we call ``uv_pipe_pending_count()`` to ensure that a handle is "
"available to read out. If your program could deal with different types of"
" handles, ``uv_pipe_pending_type()`` can be used to determine the type. "
"Although ``accept`` seems odd in this code, it actually makes sense. What"
" ``accept`` traditionally does is get a file descriptor (the client) from"
" another file descriptor (The listening socket). Which is exactly what we"
" do here. Fetch the file descriptor (``client``) from ``queue``. From "
"this point the worker does standard echo server stuff."
msgstr "首先我们调用 ``uv_pipe_pending_count()`` 来确保有一个句柄可供读出。如果你的程序可能处理不同类型的句柄，可以使用 ``uv_pipe_pending_type()`` 来确定其类型。虽然 ``accept`` 在这段代码中看起来有些奇怪，但实际上是说得通的。``accept`` 传统上做的事情，就是从另一个文件描述符（监听套接字）中获取一个文件描述符（客户端）。这正是我们在这里做的事情：把文件描述符（``client``）从 ``queue`` 中取出。从这里开始，工作进程做的就是标准回显服务器的事情。"

#: ../../src/guide/processes.rst:374
msgid ""
"Turning now to the master, let's take a look at how the workers are "
"launched to allow load balancing."
msgstr "现在转到主进程这一侧，来看看工作进程是如何被启动以实现负载均衡的。"

#: ../../src/guide/processes.rst:377 ../../src/guide/processes.rst:386
#: ../../src/guide/processes.rst:405
msgid "multi-echo-server/main.c"
msgstr "multi-echo-server/main.c"

#: ../../src/guide/processes.rst:383
msgid ""
"The ``child_worker`` structure wraps the process, and the pipe between "
"the master and the individual process."
msgstr "``child_worker`` 结构体封装了进程本身，以及主进程与各个进程之间的管道。"

#: ../../src/guide/processes.rst:393
msgid ""
"In setting up the workers, we use the nifty libuv function "
"``uv_cpu_info`` to get the number of CPUs so we can launch an equal "
"number of workers. Again it is important to initialize the pipe acting as"
" the IPC channel with the third argument as 1. We then indicate that the "
"child process' ``stdin`` is to be a readable pipe (from the point of view"
" of the child). Everything is straightforward till here. The workers are "
"launched and waiting for file descriptors to be written to their standard"
" input."
msgstr "在设置工作进程时，我们使用 libuv 中很好用的 ``uv_cpu_info`` 函数来获取 CPU 的数量，从而可以启动相同数量的工作进程。同样重要的是，初始化充当 IPC 通道的管道时要把第三个参数设为 1。接着我们指明子进程的 ``stdin`` 将是一个可读管道（从子进程的角度来看）。到这里为止，一切都简单直接。工作进程已经启动，正在等待文件描述符写入它们的标准输入。"

#: ../../src/guide/processes.rst:401
msgid ""
"It is in ``on_new_connection`` (the TCP infrastructure is initialized in "
"``main()``), that we accept the client socket and pass it along to the "
"next worker in the round-robin."
msgstr "正是在 ``on_new_connection`` （TCP 基础设施在 ``main()`` 中初始化）中，我们接受客户端套接字，并把它按轮转方式传递给下一个工作进程。"

#: ../../src/guide/processes.rst:412
msgid ""
"The ``uv_write2`` call handles all the abstraction and it is simply a "
"matter of passing in the handle (``client``) as the right argument. With "
"this our multi-process echo server is operational."
msgstr "``uv_write2`` 调用处理了全部的抽象，只需把句柄（``client``）作为正确的参数传入即可。有了这些，我们的多进程回显服务器就可以运行了。"

#: ../../src/guide/processes.rst:416
msgid ""
"Thanks to Kyle for `pointing out`_ that ``uv_write2()`` requires a non-"
"empty buffer even when sending handles."
msgstr "感谢 Kyle `pointing out`_：``uv_write2()`` 即使在发送句柄时也需要一个非空缓冲区。"

#: ../../src/guide/processes.rst:423
msgid ""
"In this section domain sockets stands in for named pipes on Windows as "
"well."
msgstr "在本节中，域套接字在 Windows 上也代指命名管道。"

